{"id":"25902d0bd75ea963","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-finite-path-closure.md","title":"Reflexive Transitive Closure","display":"df-reflexive-transitive-closure — Reflexive Transitive Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-finite-path-closure","aliases":["73-df-finite-path-closure","73-df-reflexive-transitive-closure"],"display":"df-reflexive-transitive-closure — Reflexive Transitive Closure","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-finite-path-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-finite-path-closure</span><span>73-df-reflexive-transitive-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflexive-transitive-closure — Reflexive Transitive Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (binary relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RTC}_X(R)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(x,y)\\in X^2:\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to X\\;\\bigl(\\\\\ns(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;((s(i),s(i+1))\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RTC}_X(R)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(x,y)\\in X^2:\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to X\\;\\bigl(\\\\\ns(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;((s(i),s(i+1))\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> gives reflexivity; concatenating two finite witness sequences gives transitivity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RTC}_X(R)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{(x,y)\\in X^2:\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to X\\;\\bigl(\\\\\ns(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;((s(i),s(i+1))\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":888,"backlinks":[{"id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])"},{"id":"c57bbf0a680e199a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])"},{"id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])"},{"id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_Q$ 见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"},{"id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])"},{"id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$；$B\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$；方向符号、位移 $d$ 和带更新见 [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]；$\\operatorname{RTC}$ 见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"},{"id":"0f6dbde032017491","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RTC}(R)$ 在本文件固定载集 $\\mathrm{Config}_M$ 上解释为 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]] 的 $\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\mathrm{Config}_M}(R)$。"},{"id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])"},{"id":"ab975c5a8c0c0424","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件的 $\\mathrm{RTC}$ 固定载集为 $\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M$，见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}